(6507,'You can place a new block in a region by selecting <em>Place block</em> on the <a href=\":blocks\">Block layout page</a>. Once a block is placed, it can be moved to a different region by drag-and-drop or by using the <em>Region</em> drop-down list, and then clicking <em>Save blocks</em>.','','none'),
(6508,'Block placement is specific to each theme on your site. Changes will not be saved until you click <em>Save blocks</em> at the bottom of the page.','','11.2.2'),
