(7901,'Configure the settings of a block that was previously placed in a region of a theme.','','11.2.2'),
(7902,'Click the name of the theme that contains the block.','','11.2.2'),
(7903,'Optionally, click <em>Demonstrate block regions</em> to see the regions of the theme.','','11.2.2'),
(7904,'If you only want to change the region where a block is located, or the ordering of blocks within a region, drag blocks to their desired positions and click <em>Save blocks</em>.','','11.2.2'),
