(8562,'The mappings linked to the breakpoints group','','none'),
(8563,'About searching','','none'),
(8564,'You can display your shortcuts by enabling the <em>Shortcuts</em> block on the <a href=\":blocks\">Blocks administration page</a>. Certain administrative modules also display your shortcuts; for example, the core <a href=\":toolbar-help\">Toolbar module</a> provides a corresponding menu link.','','none'),
