(8740,'For configuration entities, find the specific entity that you want to translate on the next page, and click <em>Translate</em> under <em>Operations</em>.','','none'),
(8741,'Enter translations for the translatable text fields for the configuration item, and save.','','none'),
(8742,'Configuring content language settings and translation','','none'),
(8743,'Under <em>Custom language settings</em>, find the content entity types that should have customized language settings on your site. Check the box next to each one. A section will appear below the list with settings for that entity type.','','none'),
(8744,'For each entity type you checked, in the settings section below check the boxes for each entity sub-type that should be <em>Translatable</em> on your site. If the entity type does not have sub-types, there is just one check box for the entity type as a whole.','','none'),
