(8746,'For each <em>Translatable</em> type or sub-type, look through the list of fields for the type or sub-type, and verify that only the fields that should be translatable are checked. For example, you would probably want to translate a <em>Title</em> field, but you might not want to translate a <em>Start date</em> field.','','none'),
(8747,'Click <em>Save configuration</em> when all of your changes are complete.','','none'),
(8748,'Working with languages and translations','','11.2.2'),
(8749,'What text can be translated in your site?','','11.2.2'),
(8750,'There are three types of text that can be translated:','','11.2.2'),
(8751,'User interface text that is provided by the core software, your install profile, themes, and modules is provided in English, but can be translated into other languages. You can also download translations that community-members have provided.','','11.2.2'),
(8752,'Working with languages overview','','11.2.2'),
(8753,'Adding a language','','11.2.2'),
