(9104,'The built in WYSIWYG editor (CKEditor 5) comes with a number of accessibility features. CKEditor 5 comes with built in <a href=\":shortcuts\">keyboard shortcuts</a>, which can be beneficial for both power users and keyboard only users.','','none'),
(9105,'To support multilingual page content, CKEditor 5 can be configured to include a language button in the toolbar.','','none'),
