(9574,'In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; <em>@datetime_link</em>.','','11.2.2'),
(9575,'In the <em>Error pages</em> section, enter the URL for your 403/404 pages, starting after the site home page URL. For example, if your site URL is <em>https://example.com</em> and your 404 page is <em>https://example.com/not-found</em>, you would enter <em>/not-found</em>.','','11.2.2'),
